report={'review':'Independent phase020 current-intake planning accuracy review; no activation or contract gate','feature':'phase020','reviewer':'/root/validator133','attempt':1,'limit':3,'root_release':base,'reviewed_commit':revision,'inputs':expected,'confirmed':['Exact three-file draft/pending refresh only; spec/list0.1.2 validate root+installed schemas. Entire feature objects/acceptance/dependencies, case_matrix/shared lanes and original budget prose are unchanged.7350/9555 including3750process remain proposed;129-132 order, full17-row13-case requirement and normative017/016/018/020/019 DAG remain.','All immutable path/revision/hash refs in list/current delta independently resolve. Prior reviewed645 prerequisite refresh and529/56 analyses are reused byte-identically. Bounded128 fourteen-leaf qualification is distinct from future fullSBCL/isolation/hermetic conformance and131sixthjob.','CurrentAPI5f versus historical123API2579 matches actual immutable source bytes. Historical119/120/123 captures remain prerequisites, not current controls-ready proof or liveRoot120migration; optional133 is no new normative129dependency.','Old104main38817712498/c8 allfive success matches admitted report. Current133local gates/capture, mixedQAselectedeight/originalfailure and immutable3024/2600failed budget retain their boundaries; prior deliveryexception funds no020allocation or futuregate waiver.','PR105head441d2925 and runs38831271485inprogress/38831271516success match captured intake snapshot; no mutable-status carryforward or premature merge/main pass. Frozen PRbranch/head remains untouched.','129 is planning-eligible only. SeparateRootrelease permits planning/precode overlap105CI. Approved020activation/allocation, both independent precodecontract gates, reviewed frozen tests and105normalmerge precede implementation; newintegration waits105mainallfive. Full131acceptance remains future.','All maintained prioranalysis/pair/delta/review/static preparation counts once to future020process3750, disjoint133/old018/heldcomparison. No freebucket, rebaseline, Source/runtime/test/install/model/CI/scope execution or Rootstate/lifecycle/debt edit.'],'evidence':{'static_frame':'/home/cnross/.tmp/nizam-020-intake-context-review1/review.execution.json','static_stdout':'/home/cnross/.tmp/nizam-020-intake-context-review1/review.stdout.txt','immutable_ref_occurrences_verified':len(refs),'diff_check_pid':p.pid,'diff_check_actual_exit':p.returncode},'preparation_note':'Initial outer wrapper returned SyntaxError1 for nonASCII text in a bytes literal before any capture child started; corrected wrapper encodes Unicode source. No prior static review result or Source/test execution was produced or relabelled.','final_verdict':{'approved':True,'summary':'Approve bounded draft020 current-intake accuracy refresh; unchanged scope/acceptance/budget and future activation/implementation/delivery gates remain explicit.'},'issues':[],'missing_acceptance_coverage':[],'unsupported_claims':[]}
